{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 40, :comments ["<b>And see</b> Three verse-beginnings in the Masorah: here and the other (הושע ח:ו) וְרָאֵה אִם דֶּרֶךְ עֹצֶב בִּי, and the other (דברים ד:כה) וְרָאֵה בָנִים לְבָנֶיךָ. The meaning: 'If a man sin' etc. (ובא) etc. 'in this house' — and if you do so, 'and see sons for your sons.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:26.413511952Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}